        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-20T20:09:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>In the case of&nbsp;Proletariot, you actually have cards that directly call out&nbsp;Proletariot. &nbsp;At least to me it could affect your play whereas Fright Train vs EW Bunker wouldn't have that sort of interaction. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm not saying its gonna happen. But it would work thematically as a villain who would help fight Terminus.</p>",
